  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 4th level, when a dynamic warrior makes a Will save he rolls twice and takes the better result. If he is making the same save as an ally within 30 feet of him the dynamic warrior may, by expending 2 momentum, grant this bonus to that ally. He may pay 1 more momentum per additional ally to grant the bonus to multiple allies.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dynamic-warrior#toc46\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
